<title>DENMARK: Unidanmark full year 1996 profits slip.</title>
<headline>Unidanmark full year 1996 profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 mths to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Pre-tax result &amp; extraordinary items  2,801  vs  2,969  Group net result			    2,025  vs  2,116</p>
<p> Losses and bad debt provisions	    963  vs  1,248</p>
<p> Securities and forex results		954  vs  1,157</p>
<p> Net interest and fees income	    8,931  vs  8,794</p>
<p> Result of financial items		10,156  vs 10,254</p>
<p> Operating costs			     5,822  vs  5,639</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result			2,337  vs  2,184</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (pct)		   unchanged 10</p>
<p>Balance end-1996 327.4 billion vs 255.2 billion end-1995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish banking group is Unidanmark A/S. It said in a statement that it expected ongoing growth in loans and mortgages in 1997 with costs and depreciation unchange  </p>
<p>The result was slightly below analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
